# 🎬 A-Z Movies

A responsive movie discovery website built with HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

## Features

* Dynamic movie cards generated from JavaScript data
* Live movie search
* Trailer modal with embedded YouTube videos
* Infinite carousel
* Responsive navigation menu
* Mobile-friendly design

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript (Vanilla JS)

## What I Learned

* DOM Manipulation
* Responsive Design
* Event Handling
* Dynamic Rendering
* CSS Animations
* Building an Infinite Carousel from Scratch

## Future Improvements

* Favorites system using Local Storage
* Movie API integration
* Categories and filters
* Dark/Light theme toggle
